From 93a3bceed927b6728a05fcff69edcf121a5b2be9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:47:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1817/3799] soh: rename func_809A9DC0 ->
 EffectSsKakera_ClearAccel

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: zeroes the acceleration before the per-frame force passes accumulate into it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c  | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
index fc5e86047..51d4b927b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
@@ -186,7 +186,8 @@ void EffectSsKakera_UpdateRotation(EffectSs* this) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_809A9DC0(EffectSs* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809A9DC0: zeroes the acceleration before the per-frame force passes accumulate into it.
+void EffectSsKakera_ClearAccel(EffectSs* this) {
     this->accel.x = this->accel.y = this->accel.z = 0.0f;
 }
 
@@ -311,7 +312,7 @@ s32 func_809AA0EC(EffectSs* this) {
     Vec3f diff;
     f32 dist;
 
-    func_809A9DC0(this);
+    EffectSsKakera_ClearAccel(this);  // was func_809A9DC0 [LLM:HIGH]
 
     diff.x = this->pos.x - this->vec.x;
     diff.y = this->pos.y - this->vec.y;
